  <name>Akamai Staging</name>
  <summary>Manage Akamai staging environments via hosts file modifications</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Akamai Staging is an application designed to discover Akamai staging network IPs and easily manage hosts file entries for testing staging configurations.
    </p>
  </description>
